            "at": "same"
          },
          {
            "not": {
              "star": "天機",
              "at": "same"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "太陰化祿，你因朋友的助力或下屬的扶持而進財。",
      "en": "Tai Yin in Abundance: money comes to you through friends’ help or your staff’s support.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.僕役.太陰.1",
        "quote": "主因友人助力"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "僕役.太陰.權",
      "role": "refine",
      "when": {
        "hua": "權",
        "star": "太陰",
        "at": "same"
      },
      "text": "太陰化權，你在財權方面從朋友、下屬那裡得益。",
      "en": "Tai Yin in Authority: friends and staff help you where control of money is concerned.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.僕役.太陰.2",
        "quote": "则主在财权方面得益"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "僕役.太陰.科",
      "role": "refine",
      "when": {
        "hua": "科",
        "star": "太陰",
        "at": "same"
      },
      "text": "太陰化科，你得到忠誠可靠的朋友或下屬。",
      "en": "Tai Yin in Recognition: you gain loyal, dependable friends or staff.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.僕役.太陰.3",
        "quote": "主得忠诚可靠之友人"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "僕役.太陰.忌",
      "role": "refine",
      "when": {
        "hua": "忌",
        "star": "太陰",
        "at": "same"
      },
      "text": "太陰化忌，你容易受朋友牽連而破財，或受影響去投資而損失。",
      "en": "Tai Yin in Obstruction: friends can drag you into losses, or talk you into investments that go wrong.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.僕役.太陰.4",
        "quote": "则主受牵连而破财"
      }
    },
    {
