          {
            "star": "祿存",
            "at": "same"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "太陰與火星、鈴星或祿存同宮，你常為朋友或下屬的事奔忙。",
      "en": "Tai Yin with Huo Xing, Ling Xing or Lu Cun: you are often busy running about for friends or staff.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.僕役.太陰.5",
        "quote": "皆主为友人或下属之事而奔忙"
      }
    },
