      "text": "太陰見〔吉〕又見〔煞〕，你得力的下屬常常更換，友誼也難長久。",
      "en": "Tai Yin meets 〔good signs〕 but also 〔harsh stars〕: capable staff come and go, and friendships rarely last.",
